More specifically the gradients can be too large out in the tails,
or the large gradients can frustrate adaptation.  This information
can also be built into the model directly by standardizing the
parameters, i.e.  from

parameters {
  real theta;
}

to

transformed data {
  real mu;
  real sigma;
  mu = ;
  sigma ;
}

parameters {
  real theta_tilde;
}

transformed parameters {
  real theta;
  theta = mu + sigma * theta_tilde;

}

